{"id":"vod_bf_28955","vodId":"28955","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"三坪房间的侵略者","name_cn":"三坪房间的侵略者","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-30/c0c5336d03c9ddc1630d1a73bcf4f0fe.jpg"},"summary":"里见孝太郎（中村悠一 配音）是一位看似再普通不过的高中生，居住在房租极为廉价的可乐娜庄公寓106号房间，过着平静的生活。令孝太郎再也没有想到的是，在某一天，他波澜不惊的生活会因为一位少女的出现而彻底遭到改变。　　少女名叫东本愿早苗（铃木惠理 配音），她的真实身份竟然是寄宿在106号房间的幽灵，在企图吓跑孝太郎的计划失败后，早苗开始渐渐习惯起了和孝太郎“同居”的生活。想和孝太郎争夺房间的可不止早苗一个，身材火爆的古文明末裔仓野奇莉华（田泽茉纯 配音）、不期而至的魔法少女虹野由莉佳（大森日雅 配音）、从外太空远道而来的皇女提亚蜜思林（长绳麻理亚 配音），这些接二连三出现的美少女们，每一个人都将106号房间作为了侵略的目标。为了保护自己赖以生存的廉价租房，孝太郎的“战争”开始了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 17:58:51","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/sanpingfangjiandeqinluezhe/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/sanpingfangjiandeqinluezhe/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241024PhClGM4Bindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241024WpFKDFxOindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/sanpingfangjiandeqinluezhe/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241024BaQqX2u5index.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/sanpingfangjiandeqinluezhe/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241024UUMznfIGindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241024gJcQ2SnPindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/sanpingfangjiandeqinluezhe/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241024iFQkMz1wi